            "Biological exposure, sewage, stagnant water, and hygiene addressed",
            "Lead, asbestos, silica, mold, and legacy material routes addressed",
            "Rigging, pipe handling, stored energy, and pinch points controlled",
            "Public, occupant, open-hole, trip, and housekeeping hazards controlled"
